<section class="fragment-experiment" data-artifact="experiment" data-slice="experiment-flags">
  <div class="ex-arms" role="img" aria-label="Two arms, 50 percent each: flag off and flag on, each playing every fixture on the same seed">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 400 44" width="100%" height="44" aria-hidden="true">
      <rect x="0" y="6" width="199" height="32" rx="4" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.18"></rect>
      <rect x="201" y="6" width="199" height="32" rx="4" fill="currentColor" fill-opacity="0.36"></rect>
      <text x="100" y="27" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="currentColor">control · flag off · 50%</text>
      <text x="300" y="27" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="currentColor">treatment · flag on · 50%</text>
    </svg>
    <p class="ex-note">Paired: every fixture is played by both arms on the same match seed, 1000 matches per suite per arm.</p>
  </div>
  <table class="ex-guards">
    <thead><tr><th>Guardrail (on arm)</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Direction</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>darkpath.match_without_stats</td><td>0 matches</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
      <tr><td>darkpath.change_never_applied</td><td>0 changes</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
      <tr><td>validate.violations</td><td>0 violations</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
      <tr><td>bench.match_wall_ms, on over off</td><td>1.10 ratio</td><td>lower is better</td></tr>
      <tr><td>stronger-team win rate</td><td>0.50 share</td><td>higher is better</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <ol class="ex-rule">
    <li>Any guardrail breach in the on arm: <strong>on-rejected</strong>.</li>
    <li>Otherwise, the arm that passes more of the four bands wins.</li>
    <li>On equal passes, the arm closer to the band centres by more than 0.05 wins.</li>
    <li>Otherwise <strong>no-difference</strong>, and the candidate is removed.</li>
  </ol>
  <style>
    .fragment-experiment .ex-arms { margin: 4px 0 12px; }
    .fragment-experiment .ex-note { font-size: 0.85rem; opacity: 0.85; margin: 4px 0 0; }
    .fragment-experiment .ex-guards { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .fragment-experiment .ex-guards th, .fragment-experiment .ex-guards td { text-align: left; padding: 6px 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(127,127,127,0.25); }
    .fragment-experiment .ex-rule { margin-top: 12px; padding-left: 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 480px) { .fragment-experiment .ex-guards th:nth-child(3), .fragment-experiment .ex-guards td:nth-child(3) { display: none; } }
  </style>
  <script>
    (function () {
      var root = document.currentScript.closest('.fragment-experiment');
      var guards = root ? root.querySelectorAll('.ex-guards tbody tr').length : 0;
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('sdlc:fragment-ready', { detail: { name: 'experiment', artifact: 'experiment', counts: { arms: 2, guardrails: guards } } }));
    })();
  </script>
</section>
